        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: \"Slow Turning\", \"The Rookie\", \"Drive South\", Slow Turning\n- People: Dennis Quaid, John Lee Hancock, John Hiatt, Mark Ciardi, Kevin Costner\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Mayhem\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, John Hiatt recorded the song \"Drive South\" on his album Slow Turning.\n- In 2002, \"Slow Turning\" was featured in the motion picture drama \"The Rookie\".\n- In 2002, \"The Rookie\" was released as a sports drama film directed by John Lee Hancock and produced by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- In 2002, Dennis Quaid starred in \"The Rookie\".\n- At Mayhem, Mark Ciardi produced films including \"The Rookie\", \"Miracle\", \"Invincible\", \"The Game Plan\", \"Secretariat\", \"Million Dollar Arm\", and Kevin Costner's \"McFarland USA\".",
